lopment Plan — annotated Container diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Copy of the Container diagram with requirements (R1–R5), per-container security, fakes, MVP scope and build order.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#777777"&gt;Resource Center · CIS3039 · 2026-11-18&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="760" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value='&lt;font style="font-size:15px"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Campus Device Loan System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Software System]&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;spacing=10;dashPattern=8 4;metaEdit=1;rotatable=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="400" width="1640" height="1260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value='&lt;font style="font-size:15px"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Loan service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Service boundary — owns PostgreSQL and the outbox]&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;spacing=10;dashPattern=8 4;metaEdit=1;rotatable=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="700" width="760" height="840" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value='&lt;font style="font-size:15px"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notifications service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Service boundary — owns Cosmos DB]&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;spacing=10;dashPattern=8 4;metaEdit=1;rotatable=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;absolute